fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gl-egl/gsteglimage.html#GstEGLImageDestroyNotify","fragment":"\n\tGstEGLImageDestroyNotify\n\n\n\tGstGLEGL.EGLImageDestroyNotify\n\n\n\tGstGLEGL.EGLImageDestroyNotify\n\nFunction to be called when the GstEGLImage is destroyed. It should free\nthe associated EGLImage if necessary\nParameters:\na GstEGLImage\nuser data passed to gst_egl_image_new_wrapped\nFunction to be called when the GstEGLImage is destroyed. It should free\nthe associated EGLImage if necessary\nParameters:\na GstGLEGL.EGLImage\nuser data passed to GstGLEGL.EGLImage.prototype.new_wrapped\nFunction to be called when the GstEGLImage is destroyed. It should free\nthe associated EGLImage if necessary\nParameters:\na GstGLEGL.EGLImage\nuser data passed to GstGLEGL.EGLImage.new_wrapped\n"});